name=Butter Fingers (Auto Declutter)
id=ButterFingers
description=The anti-hoarding counterpart to Sticky Fingers. Automatically drops (or dumps into a bin) the junk you don't want — empty containers, broken items, read books, plus anything you tag — while protecting your favourites. Mark items "unwanted" to drop them, tag dump containers, and pick something back up to auto-protect it. Fully configurable.
